decision_conditions:
Condition : 3 - No development shall take place above ground level until details and samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. 
The samples/details shall include: 
 	brick (including protruding brick detail/soldier coursing); 
 	tiles;
 	doors and window treatments (including sections and reveals) and;
 	any other materials/details to be used.
The development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with the approved details and maintained as such thereafter.
